sequenceDiagram
    participant D as Original Grove driver
    participant R1 as Full Ravel 1.1.0 keg
    participant F as Finish in Claude Code
    participant N as Frozen native plugin cache
    participant B as Explicit attempt backup
    participant H as Real HOME
    participant R2 as Promoted Ravel 2.0.0
    D->>R1: Launch finish through policy.ts
    R1->>F: Original mandate and ending
    F->>N: Read guidance by absolute path
    F->>F: Release Grove, verify pair, promote Ravel
    F->>H: native-off before any default launch or preflight
    F->>F: Checklist, input comparison, source acceptance
    F->>F: Retain attempt note and literal recovery command
    F->>B: Copy and verify all planned original items
    Note over F,H: Observe idle parent and MCP servers throughout switch and probes
    F->>H: Install hooks, deactivate native copies, activate Ravel last
    F->>R2: Resolve and run both harness probes
    R2-->>F: Reads, hooks and owned-service cleanup evidence
    F->>N: Reread guidance and compare registrations
    alt Probes and final comparisons pass
        F->>H: Receipt and append-only manual observation
        F->>R1: Exact original ending command
    else Failure after backup, owned services ended
        B->>H: Full native restore, Ravel sources off
        F->>H: Invalidate receipt and append correction
        F->>F: Verify native return and stop without success
    else Service cleanup incomplete
        F->>F: Keep backup; owner resolves the service before restore
    end
    Note over D,R1: Keep original keg until driver's reap
    Note over B,H: Restart uses explicit attempt instructions; later drift refuses overwrite
